{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>myGPS Map Camera 是一款把座標、地址、地圖縮圖、時間與天氣等位置資訊直接壓印在照片上的相機工具，適合地盤巡查、工程檢查、送貨記錄、外勤報告與旅遊留念。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-6.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自訂位置印章資訊</h2>\n<p>每張照片可自訂顯示座標、街道地址、Plus Code、地圖縮圖、海拔、指南針方向、GPS 準確度、日期時間及可選天氣，另有六種印章版面，從詳細報告面板到簡潔資訊條均可切換。相同 GPS 資料會寫入相片 EXIF，直向與橫向拍攝都可即時預覽最終效果。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-1-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-2-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-3-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-4-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：myGPS Map Camera</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/mygps-map-camera/id6811581380?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:07.382892+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":295,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T22:35:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T04:19:23.487664+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:05.793850+00:00","content_hash":"c01c3c285af9db2daa3a08b3b6e2f4e6850f9b6dd67fd55d824966f76270e8a4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}